{"5073660":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"VampOS: Red Ledger","steam_appid":5073660,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VampOS is an incremental management game played entirely through a vampire’s operating system.<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/450101dac24b85a69673b002cf46bd16.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternity is a valuable resource. Why spend yours chasing dinner?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With VampOS, you can build a thriving blood business from the comfort of your desktop. Install applications, automate your operations, and turn mortal resources into immortal ambition. Keep the blood flowing, keep the humans unsuspecting, and prepare an offering worthy of the Blood God.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/964f4ca95e9b20aa703a74296a54c460.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every successful enterprise starts with a reliable supply.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RedHarvest.exe<\/strong> puts blood collection at your fingertips, while <strong>DonorNet.exe<\/strong> helps you cultivate a more sustainable relationship with your donors. Expand your human populations, acquire better equipment, and grow your operation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A returning donor is a repeat customer. Depending on your business model.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/9a0ba478a8b9771bdb0ec528e2ba056f.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You didn’t become immortal to do everything yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Household.exe<\/strong> to turn humans into obedient Thralls and assign crews to repeatable work. Recruit Familiar supervisors, configure their policies, and upgrade your operations for greater speed and yield.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just maintain their Mana supply. Even absolute loyalty has operating costs.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/dab128fcbbe92fb514b24fc4c0139cb6.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raw blood is only the beginning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your own blood products in <strong>Hemotech.exe<\/strong>. Choose formulas, invest in research, and put your workforce on the production line. Then open <strong>Bram Broker.exe<\/strong> to sell your stock and fulfil delivery contracts with demanding specifications and deadlines.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers have particular tastes. You have a profit margin to consider.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/b38c678c59014067489cd61fa63115dc.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing business attracts attention. Yours cannot afford it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track resources and Suspicion in <strong>Red Ledger<\/strong>, then put <strong>BlackBook.exe<\/strong> to work on covert operations, stolen supplies, and infiltrating law enforcement. Balance expansion against exposure: let Suspicion reach its limit, and your company is finished.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discretion remains our most strongly recommended business practice.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/a446a5ad24435b46bda4315da5079671.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your company is temporary. Your ambition needn’t be.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>Shrine.sys<\/strong>, sacrifice your current enterprise to claim permanent perks and give your next company a stronger start. Build, offer, and begin again as your accumulated blood brings you closer to waking the Blood God.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VampOS. Because the Blood God expects results.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VampOS is an incremental management game played entirely through a vampire’s operating system.<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/450101dac24b85a69673b002cf46bd16.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternity is a valuable resource. Why spend yours chasing dinner?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With VampOS, you can build a thriving blood business from the comfort of your desktop. Install applications, automate your operations, and turn mortal resources into immortal ambition. Keep the blood flowing, keep the humans unsuspecting, and prepare an offering worthy of the Blood God.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/964f4ca95e9b20aa703a74296a54c460.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every successful enterprise starts with a reliable supply.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RedHarvest.exe<\/strong> puts blood collection at your fingertips, while <strong>DonorNet.exe<\/strong> helps you cultivate a more sustainable relationship with your donors. Expand your human populations, acquire better equipment, and grow your operation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A returning donor is a repeat customer. Depending on your business model.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/9a0ba478a8b9771bdb0ec528e2ba056f.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You didn’t become immortal to do everything yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Household.exe<\/strong> to turn humans into obedient Thralls and assign crews to repeatable work. Recruit Familiar supervisors, configure their policies, and upgrade your operations for greater speed and yield.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just maintain their Mana supply. Even absolute loyalty has operating costs.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/dab128fcbbe92fb514b24fc4c0139cb6.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raw blood is only the beginning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your own blood products in <strong>Hemotech.exe<\/strong>. Choose formulas, invest in research, and put your workforce on the production line. Then open <strong>Bram Broker.exe<\/strong> to sell your stock and fulfil delivery contracts with demanding specifications and deadlines.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers have particular tastes. You have a profit margin to consider.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/b38c678c59014067489cd61fa63115dc.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing business attracts attention. Yours cannot afford it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track resources and Suspicion in <strong>Red Ledger<\/strong>, then put <strong>BlackBook.exe<\/strong> to work on covert operations, stolen supplies, and infiltrating law enforcement. Balance expansion against exposure: let Suspicion reach its limit, and your company is finished.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discretion remains our most strongly recommended business practice.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/extras\/a446a5ad24435b46bda4315da5079671.avif?t=1793721032\" width=1170 height=140 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your company is temporary. Your ambition needn’t be.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>Shrine.sys<\/strong>, sacrifice your current enterprise to claim permanent perks and give your next company a stronger start. Build, offer, and begin again as your accumulated blood brings you closer to waking the Blood God.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VampOS. Because the Blood God expects results.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Run a vampire corporation from within a blood-red operating system. Recruit thralls, harvest victims, design blood products, manage Suspicion, and sacrifice your company for permanent power in this dark management Incremental.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/2d8fa335cea80d1c6d93d762a7d6b390443bc93b\/header.jpg?t=1793721032","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/bb7e8aad7fab9e4b7891e8bbbb99af3333e48f54\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793721032","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/bb7e8aad7fab9e4b7891e8bbbb99af3333e48f54\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793721032","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit, version 21H1 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 2 GB \/ AMD Radeon RX 560 2 GB<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1280×720 display; keyboard and mouse<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["noanimAI"],"publishers":["noanimAI"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/14f0b68b0e5ade51f23c092e09be32563ba0acbd\/ss_14f0b68b0e5ade51f23c092e09be32563ba0acbd.600x338.jpg?t=1793721032","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/14f0b68b0e5ade51f23c092e09be32563ba0acbd\/ss_14f0b68b0e5ade51f23c092e09be32563ba0acbd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793721032"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/e3f9b42954cf05c6bf329b06a6e8ad5f4ebb56d1\/ss_e3f9b42954cf05c6bf329b06a6e8ad5f4ebb56d1.600x338.jpg?t=1793721032","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5073660\/e3f9b42954cf0